{"questions":[{"id":"Q059","typeId":"解的比較","difficulty":"難","sourceRefs":["S05:p4","S04:p2"],"prompt":"方程式4x−3＝9的解，比kx+1＝5的解大1，求k。","answer":"2","explanation":"第一式解3，第二式解2，因此2k+1＝5。","answerFormat":"single-choice","verification":{"equation":null,"root":null,"domain":"rational"},"format":"single-choice","correctOptionId":"c3","options":[{"id":"c1","text":"3","misconception":"代入x＝2後把第二式+1當成−1，誤列2k−1＝5。"},{"id":"c2","text":"1","misconception":"把第二式解應比3小1誤讀成比3大1。"},{"id":"c3","text":"2"},{"id":"c4","text":"4/3","misconception":"忘記兩個解相差1，直接將第一式x＝3代入第二式。"}],"bankId":"linear-equations","category":"解一元一次方程式"},{"id":"Q062","typeId":"整數係數整除","difficulty":"難","sourceRefs":["S04:p1","S05:p4"],"prompt":"關於方程式(2k−7)x＝35，下列哪個k值會使方程式無解？","answer":"7/2","explanation":"k＝7/2時左邊係數為0，但右邊35非0。","answerFormat":"single-choice","verification":{"equation":null,"root":null,"domain":"rational"},"format":"single-choice","correctOptionId":"c2","options":[{"id":"c1","text":"4","misconception":"k＝4時係數為1，有解x＝35，不能判無解。"},{"id":"c2","text":"7/2"},{"id":"c3","text":"6","misconception":"k＝6時係數為5，有解x＝7，不能判無解。"},{"id":"c4","text":"7","misconception":"k＝7時係數為7，有解x＝5，不能判無解。"}],"bankId":"linear-equations","category":"解一元一次方程式"},{"id":"Q063","typeId":"絕對值方程式","difficulty":"難","sourceRefs":["S04:p2","S05:p3"],"prompt":"求 |3x−8|＝13 的所有解，。","answer":"-5/3,7","explanation":"3x−8＝13或−13，解為7或−5/3。","answerFormat":"single-choice","verification":{"equation":null,"root":null,"domain":"rational"},"format":"single-choice","correctOptionId":"c3","options":[{"id":"c1","text":"7","misconception":"只考慮3x−8＝13，漏掉等於−13的分支。"},{"id":"c2","text":"5/3,7","misconception":"負分支移項得到3x＝−5時，誤把負號丟掉。"},{"id":"c3","text":"-5/3,7"},{"id":"c4","text":"-5/3","misconception":"只考慮3x−8＝−13，漏掉正13的分支。"}],"bankId":"linear-equations","category":"解一元一次方程式"},{"id":"Q064","typeId":"絕對值方程式","difficulty":"難","sourceRefs":["S05:p3"],"prompt":"求 |(5−x)/4|＝6 的所有解，。","answer":"-19,29","explanation":"5−x＝24或−24，解為−19或29。","answerFormat":"single-choice","verification":{"equation":null,"root":null,"domain":"rational"},"format":"single-choice","correctOptionId":"c4","options":[{"id":"c1","text":"29","misconception":"只考慮5−x＝−24，漏掉等於24的分支。"},{"id":"c2","text":"-19","misconception":"只考慮5−x＝24，漏掉等於−24的分支。"},{"id":"c3","text":"-29,19","misconception":"移項後沒有正確處理−x的負號，兩個解都反號。"},{"id":"c4","text":"-19,29"}],"bankId":"linear-equations","category":"解一元一次方程式"},{"id":"Q065","typeId":"倒數條件","difficulty":"難","sourceRefs":["S05:p4"],"prompt":"5/(3x−4) 與 −x+7 互為倒數，求x。","answer":"39/8","explanation":"5(−x+7)＝3x−4，得x＝39/8；代入分母非0。","answerFormat":"single-choice","verification":{"equation":null,"root":null,"domain":"rational"},"format":"single-choice","correctOptionId":"c1","options":[{"id":"c1","text":"39/8"},{"id":"c2","text":"13/2","misconception":"乘積為1的等式列出後，漏掉右側3x的係數3。"},{"id":"c3","text":"31/8","misconception":"將等式右側3x−4的常數負號錯改為正。"},{"id":"c4","text":"-39/2","misconception":"倒數條件中漏掉−x的負號，改成+x。"}],"bankId":"linear-equations","category":"解一元一次方程式"},{"id":"Q066","typeId":"指數同底","difficulty":"難","sourceRefs":["S07:p1","S08:p2","S04:p1"],"prompt":"若 8^(x−1)＝4^(x+3)，求x。","answer":"9","explanation":"同底為2後，3(x−1)＝2(x+3)，故x＝9。","answerFormat":"single-choice","verification":{"equation":null,"root":null,"domain":"rational"},"format":"single-choice","correctOptionId":"c2","options":[{"id":"c1","text":"4","misconception":"把3(x−1)＝2(x+3)錯展開成3x−1＝2x+3。"},{"id":"c2","text":"9"},{"id":"c3","text":"6","misconception":"右側展開2(x+3)時漏把3乘2。"},{"id":"c4","text":"3","misconception":"改寫同底時把左側x−1錯抄成x+1。"}],"bankId":"linear-equations","category":"解一元一次方程式"},{"id":"Q067","typeId":"指數同底","difficulty":"難","sourceRefs":["S08:p2"],"prompt":"若 16^(x−2)＝8^(x+1)＝4^k，求k。","answer":"18","explanation":"4(x−2)＝3(x+1)，得x＝11；2k＝36，故k＝18。","answerFormat":"single-choice","verification":{"equation":null,"root":null,"domain":"rational"},"format":"single-choice","correctOptionId":"c3","options":[{"id":"c1","text":"11","misconception":"只算出共同指數條件的x，未再求題目要求的k。"},{"id":"c2","text":"36","misconception":"算出共同的2為底指數36後，忘記4^k＝2^(2k)。"},{"id":"c3","text":"18"},{"id":"c4","text":"9","misconception":"將4^k誤轉成2^(4k)，把共同指數36除以4。"}],"bankId":"linear-equations","category":"解一元一次方程式"},{"id":"Q068","typeId":"符號移項","difficulty":"難","sourceRefs":["S08:p1"],"prompt":"由 p/4＝1−(3q+7r)/8，用p、q表示r。","answer":"(8-2p-3q)/7","explanation":"兩側乘8後2p＝8−3q−7r。","answerFormat":"single-choice","verification":{"equation":null,"root":null,"domain":"rational"},"format":"single-choice","correctOptionId":"c4","options":[{"id":"c1","text":"8-2p-3q","misconception":"求得7r後忘記整個右側都要除以7。"},{"id":"c2","text":"(8+2p-3q)/7","misconception":"移項2p時符號錯誤，應為8減2p再減3q。"},{"id":"c3","text":"(8-2p+3q)/7","misconception":"移項3q時符號錯誤，應保留減3q。"},{"id":"c4","text":"(8-2p-3q)/7"}],"bankId":"linear-equations","category":"解一元一次方程式"},{"id":"Q069","typeId":"解的尺度","difficulty":"難","sourceRefs":["S08:p2"],"prompt":"x/3−x/7＝k 的解為m；若改為x/12−x/28＝k，新解為多少？","answer":"4m","explanation":"新方程式左側係數為原本的1/4，同樣右值需4倍未知數。","answerFormat":"single-choice","verification":{"equation":null,"root":null,"domain":"rational"},"format":"single-choice","correctOptionId":"c1","options":[{"id":"c1","text":"4m"},{"id":"c2","text":"m","misconception":"分母都放大4倍時，誤以為未知數解完全不受影響。"},{"id":"c3","text":"16m","misconception":"兩個分母各放大4倍被重複計算，誤把倍率乘成16。"},{"id":"c4","text":"m/4","misconception":"把未知數與係數誤看成正比；係數縮為1/4，解應增為4倍。"}],"bankId":"linear-equations","category":"解一元一次方程式"},{"id":"Q072","typeId":"鄰邊平均環","difficulty":"難","sourceRefs":["S04:p2"],"prompt":"五點P、Q、R、S、T依序環繞。相鄰兩數的平均依序為4、7、9、8、6，即(P+Q)/2＝4，…，(T+P)/2＝6。求P。","answer":"4","explanation":"令P＝x，則Q＝8−x，R＝6+x，S＝12−x，T＝4+x；T+P＝12，得x＝4。","answerFormat":"single-choice","verification":{"equation":null,"root":null,"domain":"rational"},"format":"single-choice","correctOptionId":"c4","options":[{"id":"c1","text":"8","misconception":"把P與Q的和8直接當成P，沒有繼續環狀消去。"},{"id":"c2","text":"6","misconception":"將T與P的平均6直接當成P，忽略T未必與P相等。"},{"id":"c3","text":"2","misconception":"把相鄰兩數的平均誤當成兩數和，所有條件都少乘2。"},{"id":"c4","text":"4"}],"bankId":"linear-equations","category":"解一元一次方程式"},{"id":"Q074","typeId":"幻方","difficulty":"難","sourceRefs":["S11:p2","S12:p4","S14:p7"],"prompt":"3×3方格每行、每列及兩條對角線的和相等。左上20、右上18、左下16、中右19，中左為★，求★。","answer":"15","explanation":"設★＝x，第一直行和x+36；中間格由對角線得x+2；中間橫列和2x+21，故x＝15。","answerFormat":"single-choice","verification":{"equation":null,"root":null,"domain":"rational"},"format":"single-choice","correctOptionId":"c2","options":[{"id":"c1","text":"19","misconception":"誤認同一行兩側必須相等，直接抄右中格19。"},{"id":"c2","text":"15"},{"id":"c3","text":"18","misconception":"把左上20與左下16的平均當左中，未使用每列同和條件。"},{"id":"c4","text":"17","misconception":"算出中心格17後，誤將中心格作為左中★的答案。"}],"bankId":"linear-equations","category":"解一元一次方程式"},{"id":"Q075","typeId":"數線絕對距離","difficulty":"難","sourceRefs":["S14:p1"],"prompt":"五個等距點P、Q、R、S、T在數線上由左至右，每段長3。原點在PT之間，且|P|+|Q|＝|T|。原點距離P多少單位？","answer":"5","explanation":"若原點距P為t且在QR間，t+(t−3)＝12−t，得t＝5，位於Q=3與R=6間；其餘區段不符。","answerFormat":"single-choice","verification":{"equation":null,"root":null,"domain":"rational"},"format":"single-choice","correctOptionId":"c3","options":[{"id":"c1","text":"3","misconception":"將原點放在Q的位置，沒有代入絕對距離檢查。"},{"id":"c2","text":"6","misconception":"直接將原點設在PT中點，忽略|P|+|Q|＝|T|的額外條件。"},{"id":"c3","text":"5"},{"id":"c4","text":"15/2","misconception":"把|T|誤當固定12，漏掉原點平移後應為12減t。"}],"bankId":"linear-equations","category":"解一元一次方程式"}]}